		complete = "I did not expect you to return from your attempt, $n.$b$bYou've fulfilled a destiny greater than that of most immortal beings.$b$bBy slaying C'Thun you've not only saved all of Azeroth, you've also tipped the scales of cosmic events beyond your comprehension.$b$bAccept these robes as a symbol of the glory and burden that will come as a consequence of your actions.$b$bMay their power aid you in the challenges that await you, god-slayer!",
