	},
	[9051] = {
		accept = "The toxin you helped me create is for a special purpose.  The great devilsaurs of the crater make it dangerous to hunt and difficult for me to survive.  Even if I possessed the necessary strength, killing a devilsaur simply allows another to move into its territory.$b$bTake this poisoned barb and stab it deep into a living devilsaur.  The toxin should pacify the creature, though I do not know how quickly...",
		complete = "Thank you, $n.  You are brave and wise.$b$bTell me, how did the devilsaur react to the toxin?",
	},
	[9052] = {
		accept = "I would ask you to help me create a toxin of sorts, to pacify a great creature living here in the crater.  It is not deadly, and only the keen eyes of a $c can hope to collect the ingredients.$b$bYou can find the bloodcap mushrooms growing within the bloodpetal sprouts all across the crater.  Gorishi stings are from the giant flying wasps inside and around the Slithering Scar, located in the southern part of the crater.",
		complete = "The ingredients at last!$b$bWith the Un'Goro soil I have collected, the toxin is easily concocted...",
	},
	[9053] = {
		accept = "It is as I feared -- the toxin is simply too weak for such a powerful creature.$b$bIf we are to create a toxin of high enough potency, you must venture to the bottom of the Temple of Atal'Hakkar, unlock the secrets of the altar and recover a putrid vine from the guardian there.  The temple is dangerous, and it would behoove you to bring friends.$b$bReturn to me when this is done.",
		complete = "At last, the toxin can be created in full. I dare not require you to inflict it upon the creature again, as I have asked too much already.$B$BYou have my thanks and respect. May you be well in your travels, $N.",
	},
	[9054] = {
		accept = "I have discovered a use for the carapace of the crypt fiend. I am able to fashion an extremely light and very deadly set of armor by combining the fragments with some of the desecrated magical armors lost in Naxxramas.$B$BBring me the items I require and I shall fashion for you a suit of armor the likes of which has never before been seen in our world!",
		complete = "Exellent $N !$B , you got everything just as i asked and now i can make a Cryptstalker Tunic.",
	},
	[9055] = {
		accept = "I have discovered a use for the carapace of the crypt fiend. I am able to fashion an extremely light and very deadly set of armor by combining the fragments with some of the desecrated magical armors lost in Naxxramas.$B$BBring me the items I require and I shall fashion for you a suit of armor the likes of which has never before been seen in our world!",
		complete = "As you don more of this armor, you will notice that your persona is changing. You will gain a preternatural ability for killing. Perhaps, even, a lust for blood.$B$BLet it be said that I will not be held responsible for what chaos you may invoke...",
	},
