		complete = "How tragic. These words, clearly meant for someone the soldier loved, never made it to their destination. The events detailed happened years ago; I'm not sure if the intended recipient still lives.$b$bThere is hope yet, however. With the names and information he gives, I might be able to locate the family! It will take some research, but the librarian in Stormwind owes me a favor...$b$bThank you for bringing this to me. With your help, we may be able to grant someone peace of mind at last.",
